    "text": "A vessel with water is placed on a weighing pan and it reads $600 \\mathrm{~g}$. Now a ball of mass $40 \\mathrm{~g}$ and density $0.80 \\mathrm{~g} \\mathrm{~cm}^{-3}$ is sunk into the water with a pin of negligible volume, as shown in figure keeping it sunk. The weighing pan will show a reading\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/rW9r6DaQvSqwpKV8WmWHLHNt3EVSO226-d7Su_nRK8k.original.fullsize.png\">",
